sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Human author
  participant D as AI Director
  participant A as Scoped agent
  participant API as Definition API
  participant V as Validator/simulator
  participant R as Repository owner
  U->>D: Approved brief and bounded scope
  D->>A: Assign schema-targeted draft work
  A->>API: Patch isolated draft
  API->>V: Validate after patch batch
  V-->>A: Findings and simulation links
  D->>R: Proposal, diff, risks, evidence, unresolved issues
  R->>API: Edit, approve, submit, or reject
  Note over A,R: Agent cannot publish or approve its own output
